et=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/53px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp/35px-Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Shattered_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">This article is about content that is <b><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inaccessible\" title=\"Category:Inaccessible\">inaccessible</a> through normal gameplay</b>. It can still be accessed via in-game exploits or third party tools.</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Non-Lethality</b> is a passive feature that forces the weapon to deal non-lethal damage. The target must not be an Undead or Construct.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This weapon deals only Non-Lethal Damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Non-Lethal_Damage\"> Condition: Non-Lethal Damage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Non-Lethal Damage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Non-Lethal_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Non-Lethal_Damage_(Condition)\" title=\"Non-Lethal Damage (Condition)\">Non-Lethal Damage</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Non-lethal damage does not kill creatures if it reduces their hit points to 0, it just leaves them unconscious.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enforcer_Club\" title=\"Enforcer Club\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Enforcer_Club_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Enforcer_Club\" title=\"Enforcer Club\">Enforcer Club</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNew